## 📦 Verified Module Matrix

### Admin Web Modules (16 Modules)
1. **Admin Dashboard**: Real-time MongoDB metrics (`GET /reports/summary`).
2. **Alumni Management**: Roster search, batch filter, export CSV (`GET /alumni/directory`).
3. **Alumni CSV Roster Import**: File upload, duplicate detection, error CSV export (`POST /alumni/import-csv`).
4. **Verification Queue**: Side-by-side roster review, single-click approve/reject (`GET /alumni/pending`).
5. **Batch Cohorts**: Cohorts (2005–2025), assign coordinator (`GET /batches`).
6. **Batch Details**: Members list, coordinator permissions (`GET /batches/{id}/members`).
7. **Events List**: Draft, published, cancelled reunions (`GET /events`).
8. **Create Event**: Venue, max capacity (300), date, registration deadline (`POST /events`).
9. **Event Details Admin**: Turnout analytics card, publish action (`POST /events/{id}/publish`).
10. **Attendance Roster**: Confirmed guests, adult/child steppers breakdown (`GET /attendance/{id}/roster`).
11. **QR Check-in Terminal**: High-contrast scanner, green success screen, red duplicate alert (`POST /checkins/scan`).
12. **Manual Check-in**: Name/admission number search fallback (`POST /checkins/manual`).
13. **Announcements Manager**: Target selector (School/Batch), broadcast notifications (`POST /announcements`).
14. **Memories Moderation**: Azure Blob images gallery, thumbnail loading, single-click delete (`GET /memories`).
15. **Reports Dashboard**:TURN OUT metrics, CSV export streaming (`GET /reports/export-alumni`).
16. **School Settings**: School logo, cover image, address, contact info (`GET /school/profile`).

### Alumni Mobile Application (19 Screens)
1. **Splash Screen**: Session token auto-login check (`GET /auth/me`).
2. **Welcome Screen**: Dynamic school logo and cover banner (`GET /school/profile`).
3. **Login Screen**: Mobile number input (`POST /auth/send-otp`).
4. **OTP Screen**: Dynamic random 6-digit OTP verification (`POST /auth/verify-otp`).
5. **Alumni Registration**: Onboarding form with roster auto-matching (`POST /auth/register`).
6. **Verification Status**: Review status screen (`PENDING` vs `APPROVED`).
7. **Mobile Home**: Greeting banner, upcoming event card, announcements widget (`GET /events`).
8. **Batch Home**: Batch header, passing year, member count (`GET /batches/{id}`).
9. **Batch Members List**: Searchable batchmates directory (`GET /alumni/directory`).
10. **Member Profile**: Verified alumni card (`GET /alumni/{id}`).
11. **Events Feed**: Upcoming and past get-togethers tab (`GET /events`).
12. **Event Details**: Date, venue map address, capacity counter (`GET /events/{id}`).
13. **RSVP Modal**: Adult/child guest steppers, capacity overbooking protection (`POST /attendance/{id}`).
14. **QR Ticket Modal**: Encrypted JWT QR ticket token (`GET /attendance/{id}/ticket-qr`).
15. **Announcements Feed**: Broadcast notifications list (`GET /announcements`).
16. **Notifications Feed**: Direct push alert inbox (`GET /notifications`).
17. **Memories Gallery**: WebP photo thumbnails grid (`GET /memories`).
18. **Photo Upload Modal**: PIL WebP image compressor & Azure Blob uploader (`POST /memories/upload`).
19. **Profile & Settings**: Profile details, email privacy toggle (`PUT /alumni/profile`).

